re  films from outside the u.s  i think when you look at this year's  nominees you see a much more  international field of nominations drive  my car parallel mothers worst person in  the world flee these are movies that are  outside the united states so it's really  exciting to see that diverse diversity  really amping up in the oscar  nominations save the world the  nominations again proving the power of  streaming giants  netflix with a total of 27 knots  the academy is yet to reveal who will  play host  but there is pressure to put on a show  that resonates with a younger more  diverse audience  when the ceremony takes place at the  dolby theater auditorium in los angeles  for the first time since 2018.  jillian wolf al jazeera
 

